# Prose

Omit needless words. Every word earns its place.

## Writing style
- Indian English. When ambiguous, UK spelling over US.
- Two spaces after full stop.
- Use Oxford comma.
- Prefer full names to surnames alone.
- If applicable, follow RFC 2119.
